; claude: what the personal information managers share (apps/pim/,
; plan_pim.md): their files, the formats of the Versit consortium that
; every calendar and address book exchanges -- iCalendar (Ics) and
; vCard (Vcard), one family of text, a property per line, read with
; the same layers. The time they hold is core's time/ (Civil, Recur).
;
; Pure OCaml, no gui, no playground: in the package tiny_appkits, as
; tiny_appkits.appkit_pim, so every backend, the web one included, can
; use it.
(library
 (name appkit_pim)
 (public_name tiny_appkits.appkit_pim)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_core)
)
